Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Delegate to brahma: write a Java 21 record class named 'UserProfile' with fields id (UUID), username (String), and createdAt (Instant). Include a static factory method 'of'.",
