POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{intentSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Tell brahma to write a Quarkus REST endpoint that returns a paginated list of users from a JPA repository.",
    "maxIterations": 5
}

###

### [DEL-15] "delegate to saraswati" → fast-path → coordinator → delegates to researcher
