POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{ghGuardSession.response.body.sessionId}}/deny?agentRole=coordinator
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [DEL-33] GitHub guard ALLOWS: github.com URL present in goal
# Expect: github call permitted, guard does not fire.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{ghGuardSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run-async
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
