### [DEL-33a] Deny (cleanup)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{ghGuardSession.response.body.sessionId}}/deny?agentRole=coordinator
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [DEL-34] GitHub guard BLOCKS: "gist" as a natural language word (false-positive risk)
# "Give me the gist of this document" contains the word "gist" but is NOT
# a GitHub resource. After the GITHUB_RESOURCE_PATTERN fix, bare "gist"
# must NOT pass the guard. Coordinator should answer without calling github.
