# produce two DISTINCT inner session IDs (UUID suffix ensures this).
# The second delegation must NOT resume from the first's checkpoint.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [DEL-39] Delegate to brahma a SECOND time in the same outer session
